+    // clipboard and Ctrl+V pasted stale content. Move the clipboard through
+    // xclip on the XWayland side instead: X11 clients need no focus, and the
+    // compositor mirrors the X11 CLIPBOARD selection to the Wayland clipboard.
+    const xclipRead = () =>
